{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"markets","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get market holders"},"description":"The S, A and B graded wallets holding one Polymarket market, from a complete provider holder scan: shares, Polymarket's currentValue for the leg, grade, win record in the market's category, and badges. A wallet holding both outcomes is listed once on its net side. Ordered by current value. The roster is at most 60 seconds old over a provider walk at most 180 seconds old; scan.fetched_at is its only timestamp. An incomplete scan is an error with a retry time, never a shorter list. C, D, F and ungraded wallets are never listed and are counted only in scan.wallet_count. Counts differ from get_positions by design: a live scan, the graded cohort, and no 100 USD size floor.\n\nArgs:\n  - condition_id (string, required): Raw provider condition_id or the mkt_-prefixed market id\n  - outcome (string, optional): yes, no, or all (default)\n  - min_grade (string, optional): S keeps S, A keeps S and A, B (default) keeps S, A and B\n  - limit (number, 1-100, default 20): Holders per page\n  - cursor (string, optional): next_cursor from the previous page, bound to the same market and filters\n\nReturns: data (holders), has_more, next_cursor, total, market, scan, totals and meta.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"condition_id":{"description":"Raw provider condition_id or the mkt_-prefixed market id","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"cursor":{"description":"next_cursor from the previous page; it is bound to the same market and filters","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":20,"description":"Max holders per page (1-100, default 20)","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"min_grade":{"description":"Narrow the graded cohort: S keeps S, A keeps S and A, B (the default) keeps S, A and B","enum":["S","A","B"],"typ